				""
				"{image:kubejs:textures/esu7.png width:341 height:192 align:center fit:true}"
				"&6The village square hums with excitement as the Beekeeper Market opens its stalls, showcasing golden honey, beeswax crafts, and fragrant herbal products. Beekeepers share stories of their buzzing friends, teaching the importance of bees in the garden and fields.&r"
